{"id":778283,"title":"04｜思维的边界：批判性思维如何塑造prompt？","content":"批判性思维在Prompt工程中的应用至关重要，它不仅包括对他人的观点进行质疑，也包括自我反思。苏格拉底通过提问引导对话者深入思考，体现了批判性思维的价值。将这一思维方式应用于提示词工程，关键在于学会提问，从清晰性、准确性、关联性、逻辑性、重要性、公平性、深度和广度八个角度出发，确保问题的界定明确、基于事实、逻辑连贯且全面深入。例如，在评估“喝咖啡减少心脏病风险”的说法时，应询问实验设计是否科学合理，探讨生理机制，并考虑可能存在的相反证据及其原因。此外，培养批判性思维可通过读书学习、与他人交流、多问How（如何应用）、Why（为何如此）及Why Not（为何不能如此），从而促进更深层次的理解与创新。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":390960,"user_name":"Dexter","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2608728,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"909CABC4AC4AC9","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/27/ce/58/71ed845f.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1716880470,"is_pvip":true,"replies":null,"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100767801,"comment_content":"课件材料有吗？","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1924658,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/5e/32/c884e4ea.jpg","nickname":"Ivy","note":"","ucode":"75DAA44FE0350D","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":648603,"discussion_content":"同问？最好和得到一样有文稿","content_length":13,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1721869323,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"广东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1914859,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/37/eb/90f5769b.jpg","nickname":"保持微笑","note":"","ucode":"A8BB6462243204","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":646114,"discussion_content":"同问","content_length":2,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1717403729,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,